  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-db",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：数据库访问服务\n\nMCP Database Server 是一个为AI助手和基于LLM的工具提供安全数据库访问的服务，支持SQLite、PostgreSQL、MySQL和MariaDB，具有查询验证、审计日志和安全控制功能。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **db_tables** — List all tables in the database, optionally filtered by schema. Returns qualified table names.\n- **db_describe_table** — Get column information for a specific table including column names, data types, and nullability.\n- **db_execute** — Execute a SQL statement. Supports SELECT (read), INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE (write if enabled), and DDL (if enabled). Use named parameters with :param syntax.\n- **db_explain** — Get query execution plan and performance information using EXPLAIN. Helps analyze query performance and optimization opportunities."
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-db\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-db\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
